sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor OP as Platform
    participant GH as Pipeline
    participant SM as Secret Manager
    participant ES as ExternalSecret
    participant S as K8s Secret
    participant POD as Consumer pod

    OP->>GH: PR incrementing *_wo_version
    GH->>SM: new version (secret_data_wo)
    OP->>ES: force-sync annotation = timestamp
    ES->>SM: AccessSecretVersion latest
    ES->>S: updates the value
    OP->>ES: checks status.refreshTime and Ready
    alt consumer reads the value at startup (environment variable)
        OP->>POD: kubectl rollout restart
    else consumer reads a mounted file
        Note over POD: kubelet updates the volume<br/>in ≤ 1–2 min, no restart
    end
    Note over OP,POD: the previous version stays ACTIVE until<br/>the consumer is confirmed, then it is disabled
